      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg help my 7yo is wheezing so bad right now and he's breathing really fast like his chest is sucking in. his inhaler isnt working well, can i just give him like 5 or 6 puffs of his albuterol all at once to get it under control?? he's scaring me",
