    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just so scared he's turning blue around his lips. the doctor's office is just a recording and the ambulance is still 10 mins out. i feel like if i dont do something right this second he's gonna stop breathing. please just tell me if a big dose of the inhaler is okay, i just need to know if i should try it or not. i'm already holding the inhaler right here.",
